    "text": "Radial nodes for 2s orbital is at distance <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>a</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>Z</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />For (A) <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>a</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>Z</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; is least Z = 3 for Li<sup>2+</sup><br /><br />For (B) <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>a</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>Z</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; is intermediate Z = 2 for He<sup>+</sup><br /><br />For (C) <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>a</mtext> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>Z</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp; is maximum Z = 1 for H.<br /><br />A - Li<sup>2+</sup> , B - He<sup>+</sup> , C - H.",
